{"kind":"finding","id":"FN-B-time-phone-screens-1-01","date":"2026-11-26","lens":"13","surface":"phone","area":"phone/screens-1","refs":["F-phone-100"],"severity":"S3","title":"Anyone still on the old ForgeAI app is never told to move to MettleUp, and stays on it for good","what":"MettleUp is a different app on the phone from the old ForgeAI app (its Play and phone id changed when the name changed). The update check was changed on purpose so the old ForgeAI app never finds a MettleUp release, because 'updating' would put a second, empty app on the phone. Nothing replaced it: the old app finds no update at all, shows no 'Update' line, and never says MettleUp exists or how to bring the workouts across. MettleUp can read an old ForgeAI backup file, but the old app's member is never sent there.","expected":"A member still on the old ForgeAI app is told once that the app moved to MettleUp, with a short path: make a backup in ForgeAI, install MettleUp, restore that backup.","evidence":["apps/mobile/src/lib/appUpdate.ts:40-57","apps/mobile/android/app/build.gradle:92-98","apps/mobile/app.json:8"],"proof":"code-read","root_cause_key":"old-package-gets-no-move-notice","who":"members who installed the ForgeAI app by file before the rename","how_often":"every day, for as long as they keep the old app","fix_line":"Publish one last ForgeAI-named release whose only change is a screen saying 'MettleUp replaced this app' with the backup, install and restore steps","fix_size":"medium","needs_him":false,"verified":"pending","status":"open"}
